('127.721.d.6.B',4,'Before acquiring new software for a project, the student should check:','["only the box", "only the logo", "only the color", "features, cost and license terms"]'::jsonb,3,'Evaluate tools before adopting them.','original'),
('127.721.d.6.C',3,'A project file will not open on a classmate''s different operating system, so the student exports it in a shared format. This addresses:','["a compatibility issue across platforms", "a paper issue", "a font issue", "a color issue"]'::jsonb,0,'Export to a common format fixes it.','original'),
